              "type": "text",
              "text": "A car had a full tank of 56 L at the start of a 75 km journey.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At the end of the journey, the fuel tank was three quarters full.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What is the fuel consumption rate, in kilometres per litre?",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Give your answer to 2 decimal places.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
